From: 05yuki <ceu.azul.samu@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 16:44:33 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] [tier 0] deepseek-v4.1: the reference's reasoning-effort
 budgets (sgl-project/sglang#39929)

low / high / max render as 50 / 75 / 100, the reference's budgets; the
pinned commit had low 25 and high 50, so a request without an effort
(default high) thought with half the reference's budget.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C2UBZdnrDZSBh8yQz8rc9g
---
 python/sglang/srt/entrypoints/openai/encoding_dsv41.py | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/python/sglang/srt/entrypoints/openai/encoding_dsv41.py b/python/sglang/srt/entrypoints/openai/encoding_dsv41.py
index 45f24f31..1d5f8486 100644
--- a/python/sglang/srt/entrypoints/openai/encoding_dsv41.py
+++ b/python/sglang/srt/entrypoints/openai/encoding_dsv41.py
@@ -68,8 +68,8 @@ REASONING_EFFORT_TEMPLATE = (
 )
 
 REASONING_EFFORT_MAPPINGS: Dict[str, int] = {
-    "low": 25,
-    "high": 50,
+    "low": 50,
+    "high": 75,
     "xhigh": 75,
     "max": 100,
 }
